{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M5Sdwy1m1UvqG4qsmKPaPg","type":"tool_result","content":"71:(defn drain\n72-  \"Every value a reader handle holds, oldest first. The read is the\n73-   contract's own shape — a cursor minted at `:dao.stream/oldest`, then\n74-   `next` until something other than `ok` — so draining changes no state the\n75-   handle's owner depends on.\"\n76-  [handle]\n77-  (let [start (get-in (stream/cursor handle stream/anchor-oldest)\n78-                      [:dao.stream/cursor])]\n79-    (loop [cursor start\n22:(defn guard\n23-  \"Run `thunk` when slow tests are enabled on this host, else say that\n24-   `test-name` was skipped.\"\n25-  [test-name thunk]\n26-  (if (enabled?)\n27-    (thunk)\n28-    (println \"SKIP slow test\" test-name \"(set DATOM_SLOW_TESTS=1 to run)\")))","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ee657710-cc1c-4c43-882b-5874c9a79051","uuid":"028ce85d-e8ce-40ae-8511-921fc66a7454","timestamp":"2026-10-12T16:07:16.028Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"71:(defn drain\n72-  \"Every value a reader handle holds, oldest first. The read is the\n73-   contract's own shape — a cursor minted at `:dao.stream/oldest`, then\n74-   `next` until something other than `ok` — so draining changes no state the\n75-   handle's owner depends on.\"\n76-  [handle]\n77-  (let [start (get-in (stream/cursor handle stream/anchor-oldest)\n78-                      [:dao.stream/cursor])]\n79-    (loop [cursor start\n22:(defn guard\n23-  \"Run `thunk` when slow tests are enabled on this host, else say that\n24-   `test-name` was skipped.\"\n25-  [test-name thunk]\n26-  (if (enabled?)\n27-    (thunk)\n28-    (println \"SKIP slow test\" test-name \"(set DATOM_SLOW_TESTS=1 to run)\")))","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01M5Sdwy1m1UvqG4qsmKPaPg","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResult